| Method           |   Steer F1 ↑ |   Net Corr (raw) | Prec ↑   | Tgt Flip% ↑   |   Tgt Δ ↑ | Wrong% ↓   |   Wrong Δ ↓ | Arb Flip% ↓   |   Focus ↑ |   Coh ↓ |   Nats Lost ↓ |
